# | Advantech ADAM-6015 — 7-Channel RTD Input Module (Ethernet/Modbus TCP)
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2)
# | - 7-channel RTD input; PT100/PT1000/Ni604/Balco500 types selectable per channel.
# | - Modbus TCP (Ethernet), unit identifier = 1.
# | - FC03 addr 0-6: AI raw value ch 0-6 (u16, 0-65535 = full scale) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 8: AI average value ch 0-6 (u16) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 30-31..43-44: AI float value ch 0-6 (f32 IEEE754, 2 regs each) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 47-48: AI float average (f32) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 100-101..113-114: AI status ch 0-6 (f32 pair: bit0=normal, bit3=burnout) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 200-206: Type code ch 0-6 (R/W; see type code table).
# | - FC03 addr 208: Type code average (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 210-211: Module Name 1-2 (R).
# | - FC03 addr 304: GCL internal flag value (R/W).
